Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,He slaughtered our men…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,our brothers…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,our sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dead cry out to us for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,On their souls，I swear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The man who took our loved ones from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The man who has brought us such pain and sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will bring him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.77,0:04:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will not rest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,until his blood flows into this very ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.55,0:04:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will have our revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？Excuse me。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,The finish is included in the cost of the wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's okay，I'd rather do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a little obsessive that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lenore。- Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。You？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mmm，good，good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is something up？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。It's Saturday，two o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim's driving lesson？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… music lesson got switched.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Tuesday one or the Friday one？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know how kids are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Especially the ones who are desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,to pass their driving test at the third try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's not desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But she failed the test twice，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie。It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，where is she，really？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've never been a good liar，have I？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's not your forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's at her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,She has a boyfriend？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want to come in for a drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Yeah。I think you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't she tell me，for god's sake？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,She probably didn't want you running a full security check…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,of everything he's done since kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,But she's okay，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie，tell me it's none of my business…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,but are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.15,0:06:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie，if there's anything I can do…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I better…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't even know where the kid lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You found her in a city of 12 million people
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,within 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I just told you… - Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to give her her space.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.89,0:07:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,*Let me show you what I know*
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,*Let me take you where I'll go*
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,*I want to，yeah，share with you*
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,*Why won't you let me show you？*
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ur… Just wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take all the time you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，May I help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is Kim here？- Yeah，and you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Mills，what a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I get you anything？A drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just my daughter will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know how important it is for you to pass your test.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。Kim，you don't have a license？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever tried to parallel park an Escalade？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you to take the test with my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:08:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,God。Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,A pleasure to meet you，Mr。Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could we slow down a little bit，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe you just did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're leaving on fall break next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the only time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can get to do this before I go to Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We planned this。When you make plans，you keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Dad，you planned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you even find me？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mom and I were talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you have a boyfriend？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I knew you'd overreact…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I just want to feel normal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,even if I'm just pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Remember to brake before the stop。- Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom doesn't know where Jamie lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,GPS？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had it installed in your phone。I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:09:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear so many scary
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,stories of goings-on with people your age…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，I don't even know how to start feeling normal again…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,But this definitely isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，you can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use your side mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect。Why couldn't you do that in the test？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I didn't really want a license.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I know where you're coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you have to trust me to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do this again，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.27,0:11:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't go running a background check on him with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam。Hi。It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen。I want you to run a check on someone。Jamie Conrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The usual。Not too deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Pitrel？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a registered letter for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you take that up，Sebastien？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sebastien？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm a good player，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess the rules are changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,This man came to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He used a card to come into our house
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,and kill my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,And my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stu，where are you going？Come back！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's happened？Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in。I'll get Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie，talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had this trip planned to China for Kim's spring break…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,as a family，to try and work things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when Stu and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just thought it would be nice for Kim and I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,to be away together…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Away from all the tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He canceled everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just can't believe he did this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.13,0:16:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just the fighting，the lawyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's turned into such a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。This is really not your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my turn to have…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you and Kim come with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we can't impose on you。You're working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not imposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm working for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you can come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,It could be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I can't think right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure，I understand。No pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I leave in the morning。I work three days。Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're coming，I'll hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,If not，I'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll go get kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,She is definitely coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't know。- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on，Sam，I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should have insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，guys。Cut me some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's going through a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't want to make it harder on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was confiding in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！I didn't know you guys were still so cozy…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That she shares her marriage issues with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you guys were close，obviously，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,but are you close again？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close like…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll lay money she's still got something for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't go there，friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe he still has something for her！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we talk about basketball？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,For god's sake，come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You made my stay feel very secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Have a safe trip home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You also.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've reached Lenore。Leave a message after the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,No message from you…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I guess you probably found some place to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope things are a little easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you ever need to talk or anything，I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll probably ship out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No news from Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess she's busy with the boyfriend and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surprise！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。Kim，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Lennie。- Hello，Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just leaving you a message。When I didn't hear，it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,We wanted to surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys could have been surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could have been out of here and headed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom's been calling Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，yeah？- Uh-huh。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been tracking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly。You're not the only one who's got moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not too shabby，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.64,0:19:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom，look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.81,0:19:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's crazy，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's beautiful！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you so much。- My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，listen，I'll let you get settled…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'll come and collect you in half an hour？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go。- Fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，where are we heading？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I am going nowhere。I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just going to take a nice long bath and get into bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.87,0:21:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie。Are you sure？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.55,0:21:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess it's just you and me，kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything special you'd like to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kind of。Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ready to take off，too？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.15,0:22:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I thought I'd stick around for a couple of more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.53,0:22:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cool。- No。Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。Let's go。- All right。It's so crazy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,On this side is Europe，and the other side is Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.85,0:22:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,And every conquest since，for the last 2，500 years…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,whether it was the west going east or the east going west…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.89,0:22:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,they all used this very same waterway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You want some tea，baby？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just one，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know all this stuff？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do I know it？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I read it in a book on the flight over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you can borrow it if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，this Jamie…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.33,0:22:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it… serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a really smooth transition.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's only been a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you in love with him？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.09,0:23:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever been in love before？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not… not the way that mom talks about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,How does she describe it？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.02,0:23:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,She said when you guys met…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.78,0:23:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That…it was super special.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Super special？She said that？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think the exact word she used was…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Magical.」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magical，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again，my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.07,0:24:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is everything prepared？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.11,0:24:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.86,0:25:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？- He's in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.58,0:25:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait until he's outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And remember，alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.51,0:25:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's on to me。I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.48,0:25:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought we were having lunch in the bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.94,0:25:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jet lag just hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I figured l'd veg out by the pool and let you guys go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meet up with you later？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I guess。Okay with you？- Of course。It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.41,0:26:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，okay。Bye。- Hey，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.86,0:26:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,That book I was telling you about？It's on my dresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.43,0:26:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.17,0:26:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,No adventuring。I'll go call the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.13,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.33,0:26:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,l know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.66,0:26:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.15,0:26:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,The daughter is staying here。What can we do？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.84,0:26:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want all three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.72,0:26:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.43,0:26:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,She thinks we just fell off the turnip truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.54,0:26:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.43,0:26:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's trying to play Cupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.57,0:26:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.23,0:26:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，when you first came back，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,and said you wanted to make up for all that time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.37,0:26:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you lost with Kim？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.96,0:26:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought，「Right，three weeks，he's gone.」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.05,0:26:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was usually about the limit you stuck around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give or take a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.53,0:27:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.95,0:27:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really proved me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.58,0:27:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.16,0:27:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.68,0:27:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you commit to something，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.16,0:27:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,you focus all your energy there，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.24,0:27:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,like a dog with a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice analogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.03,0:27:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.81,0:27:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you give，it's 100 percent of 100 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I was on to something，it was just that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even though I tell myself I should change，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.47,0:27:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could never give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.98,0:27:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gave us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，never.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.08,0:27:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driver，turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.97,0:28:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie，don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you tell me what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.17,0:28:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.83,0:28:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see the gallery entrance in the middle of the block？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.22,0:28:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Will you tell me what's going on？- Do you see it？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.90,0:28:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we stop，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.76,0:28:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to get out of the car like you're a shopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.34,0:28:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.77,0:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you tell me what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.74,0:28:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie，there's no time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just talk to me！- Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.39,0:28:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you exit the back of the fabric store，turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.34,0:28:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the first street on the right，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.02,0:28:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,then left on the very next street.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.83,0:28:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go straight until you come to a set of steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.82,0:28:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a red corridor。It's a lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.97,0:28:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you exit the lane，there's a cab stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go back to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.27,0:29:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get Kim。Get the head of hotel security，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.69,0:29:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,and demand that he cordon off your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not open the door for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.18,0:29:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No room service，no police，no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.38,0:29:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.60,0:29:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.70,0:29:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.38,0:29:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.14,0:29:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.83,0:29:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to be ready。I need you to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.38,0:29:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driver，stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.00,0:29:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.16,0:29:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，what about you？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the guys following us who are about to have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.27,0:29:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,When a dog has a bone，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.55,0:29:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,the last thing you want to do is try and take it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.56,0:29:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.67,0:29:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.36,0:29:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Move，move，move！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.27,0:29:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir！Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Sir！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.73,0:30:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.32,0:30:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Kim，answer the goddamn phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.51,0:31:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gone！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.57,0:32:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，no！Somebody help me！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,The key！Open the door，please！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.73,0:32:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.60,0:34:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll blow his brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.77,0:34:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.28,0:34:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.03,0:34:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really wish you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.67,0:34:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me too。You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.44,0:34:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.66,0:34:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dad's calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.83,0:34:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's on a date with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.23,0:34:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll call you right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.47,0:34:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss you。Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.25,0:35:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's it going？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me carefully Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.56,0:35:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your mother and I
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.37,0:35:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,are going to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.77,0:35:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.79,0:35:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.99,0:35:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,And people are going to come for you，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.50,0:35:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave the place where you are calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.07,0:35:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go to where the book is I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.18,0:35:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a door。Go into the room and hide in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.03,0:35:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got that？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.92,0:35:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.89,0:35:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.72,0:35:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.67,0:35:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.01,0:36:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,She is in room 422.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.08,0:36:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,two，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.08,0:36:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,three，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,four，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,five
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.08,0:36:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,six.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.64,0:36:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.99,0:36:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.21,0:36:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,two，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:36:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,three，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,four.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.71,0:37:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The pool！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.64,0:37:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Security，fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.06,0:37:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you copy me？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.53,0:37:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send someone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.61,0:37:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-five，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.85,0:37:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,twenty-six，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.67,0:37:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,twenty-seven，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.60,0:37:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,twenty-eight，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.70,0:37:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,twenty-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.13,0:37:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.81,0:37:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.83,0:37:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not here？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.79,0:37:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check her dad's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.80,0:38:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hammer on metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.06,0:38:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Left。Gear shift to second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.52,0:38:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，two，three.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.20,0:38:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.28,0:38:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have them？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.32,0:38:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Efendi。Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.44,0:39:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take them to the shop，straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.52,0:39:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.91,0:39:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A flip-flop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.97,0:39:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You go left！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.27,0:39:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.64,0:39:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.89,0:39:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.16,0:39:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.06,0:40:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shot some guy！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.05,0:42:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Sam。Pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.18,0:42:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，this is Sam。Leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.61,0:42:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.01,0:42:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.26,0:42:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.86,0:42:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.32,0:42:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.50,0:42:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，listen to me very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.87,0:42:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to calm down and pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.86,0:42:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.76,0:42:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The men who came for you，did they leave？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.04,0:42:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。What do they want？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.61,0:42:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.50,0:42:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is mom okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.10,0:43:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.81,0:43:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.12,0:43:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we going to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.99,0:43:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to go to the US Embassy。You'll be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.51,0:43:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you and Mom？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.79,0:43:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.06,0:43:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you now？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.51,0:43:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't really know，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.64,0:43:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，how can I tell them where to find you，then？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.89,0:43:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't。Now get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.09,0:43:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.21,0:43:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kimmie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.17,0:43:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.27,0:43:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.29,0:43:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，if you tell me what to do，I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.42,0:43:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，this is not a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.66,0:43:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that。It's my parents' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.33,0:43:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.01,0:43:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.58,0:43:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.84,0:43:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.96,0:43:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you get out of the closet safely？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.89,0:43:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.55,0:44:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you can，take the case with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.86,0:44:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.89,0:44:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.82,0:44:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The combination is 232884.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.08,0:44:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is it open？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.51,0:44:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Do you see a map？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.34,0:44:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.97,0:44:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll see a scale on the top in kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.40,0:44:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you see it？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.07,0:44:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.78,0:44:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take a shoelace from one of my shoes in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.48,0:44:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use it as a guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.54,0:44:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a pen in the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.70,0:44:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.23,0:44:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draw a circle with the hotel in the center of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.32,0:45:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's done。-Make the diameter three kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.95,0:45:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got that？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.83,0:45:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's done。-Draw another circle with the market in the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.66,0:45:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- Do the circles intersect at any points？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.33,0:45:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.41,0:45:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，take one of those little cans，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.22,0:45:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,the ones with the pins on the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.10,0:45:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.02,0:45:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to go to the balcony with the grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.57,0:45:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there a safe place you can throw it？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.52,0:45:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a parking garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.62,0:45:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyone on it？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.74,0:45:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.46,0:45:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to pull the pin out of the grenade，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.44,0:45:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,count to three so I can hear it，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.90,0:45:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then toss it as far as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.90,0:45:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then run back into the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.57,0:45:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep the phone on so I can hear the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.27,0:45:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.53,0:45:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.78,0:45:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.86,0:46:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.83,0:46:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.82,0:46:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.94,0:46:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.02,0:46:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now draw a circle on the map with the hotel in the middle，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.26,0:46:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the circumference at 4.5 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.59,0:46:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ok。-Do the circles intersect at any points？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.14,0:46:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，at two points.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.74,0:46:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm at one of the two intersecting points.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.96,0:46:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now go outside and look at the flags on the rooftops.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.62,0:46:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you see the flags？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.08,0:46:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- Are they in the wind？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.84,0:46:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Going east，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.12,0:46:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think so，yeah。How did you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.56,0:46:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now look at the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to go to the point
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.37,0:46:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,where the circles intersect at the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.92,0:47:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to take one of the guns，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.60,0:47:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,get to a rooftop，wait for my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.33,0:47:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,And two of the grenades.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.97,0:47:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go to the rooftop at the most easterly point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.86,0:47:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up to the rooftop。Wait for my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.29,0:47:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be casual，Kim。Blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.08,0:47:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.07,0:47:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.44,0:47:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.71,0:48:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.46,0:48:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those clothes don't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.91,0:48:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.36,0:48:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a thief in here！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.64,0:49:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know this man？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.37,0:49:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.30,0:49:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.59,0:49:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.24,0:49:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.25,0:49:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You recognize none of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.96,0:50:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,To you，they were nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.64,0:50:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,But to other people，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.62,0:50:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,they are sons and grandsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.96,0:50:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fathers and husbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.32,0:50:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you killed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.97,0:50:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like they were so many nothings.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.06,0:50:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this one？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.48,0:50:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You recognize him？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.49,0:50:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.09,0:50:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Him，you didn't just kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.68,0:50:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Him，you strapped to a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.41,0:50:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You attached electric cables to the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.48,0:50:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You turned the current on，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.46,0:50:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you left it on until his heart burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.26,0:50:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the one who kidnapped
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.11,0:50:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,dozens of girls and ruined their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.93,0:50:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.61,0:50:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marko，from Tropoje.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.89,0:50:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I have come to take you to Tropoje
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.12,0:51:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,to face you to the people whose lives you have ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.93,0:51:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,To give them justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.13,0:51:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean to give them revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.00,0:51:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it gives us peace，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.92,0:51:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,call it anything you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.84,0:51:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I killed your son because he kidnapped my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.53,0:51:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care what he did！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.30,0:51:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only know I will never see his face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.45,0:51:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will never hear his voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.51,0:51:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,And as you held him responsible for your daughter，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.36,0:51:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hold you responsible for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.99,0:51:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your death will not be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.40,0:51:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It will not be pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.29,0:51:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,But before you die，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.81,0:51:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,this is what you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.41,0:51:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.28,0:51:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.19,0:52:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long will it take for the blood to rush to her head，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.53,0:52:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,and have no place to go？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.60,0:52:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,About 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.35,0:52:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are right。You're an expert for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.23,0:52:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you have 30 minutes to watch her die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.69,0:52:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,She had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.61,0:52:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do what you want with me。Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.36,0:52:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't play the hero with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.40,0:52:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we are going to catch your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.74,0:52:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,She will be sold to the lowest brothel in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.53,0:52:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.62,0:53:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,She will be abused by so many men
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.29,0:53:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,that she'll be nothing more
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.82,0:53:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,than a piece of meat a dog would not have.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.56,0:53:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't listen to them，Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.52,0:53:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.69,0:53:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I spoke with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.27,0:53:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.15,0:53:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to stay calm。Breathe slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.57,0:53:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.53,0:53:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't let anything happen to you，or to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.16,0:53:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.33,0:53:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Murad？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.79,0:53:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.25,0:53:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,We lost the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.58,0:53:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,The girl has gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.21,0:53:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be back as soon as we get her，then we move.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.25,0:53:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.17,0:53:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on，Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.57,0:54:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on，Lennie。Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.60,0:54:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.03,0:54:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.73,0:54:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sorry！Sorry！- Come back！You have to pay！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.97,0:54:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.79,0:54:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.05,0:54:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm with you，baby。I'm here。I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.12,0:55:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.92,0:55:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.07,0:55:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.70,0:55:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie。Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.03,0:55:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.11,0:55:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.86,0:55:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Set off another grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.44,0:56:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad？- You're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.51,0:56:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to keep moving east.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.64,0:56:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Count to 30 and then set off another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.02,0:56:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，two，three.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.98,0:56:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eighteen，nineteen，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.74,0:56:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,twenty-six，twenty-seven，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.41,0:56:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,twenty-eight，twenty-nine，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.06,0:56:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.22,0:56:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go out and check what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.25,0:56:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kim。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.21,0:56:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look east。Look for a white cloud of steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.74,0:56:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.54,0:56:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run to it。Tell me when you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.16,0:57:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.02,0:57:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad。- Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.72,0:57:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm right by the steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.00,0:57:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop the gun down the vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.03,0:57:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，god，they're here。They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.91,0:57:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop the gun，Kim，and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.39,0:57:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.69,0:57:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.75,0:58:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.84,1:00:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.29,1:00:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,On your knees！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.06,1:00:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.91,1:00:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.12,1:00:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.09,1:00:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！Dad！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.70,1:00:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.59,1:00:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Mom？Is she okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.83,1:00:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's safe。She's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.54,1:00:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slow down，slow down，slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.46,1:00:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got a fare.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.96,1:01:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,That man had the same tattoo as the men in paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.47,1:01:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not you they want，Kim。It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.58,1:01:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to wait here。I'm going to get Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.16,1:01:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait five minutes，and if I don't show up，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.48,1:01:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to go straight here，to the American Embassy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.68,1:01:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell them what happened。- Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.53,1:01:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No time，Kim。Give me your phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.57,1:01:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wait five minutes，not a moment longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.19,1:01:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter what happens，time runs out，you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.05,1:01:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You understand me？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.47,1:01:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.81,1:03:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.26,1:03:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.27,1:03:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.66,1:03:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.09,1:04:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Move！- You killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.97,1:04:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had no choice。Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.95,1:04:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's Mom？- She's fine，she's not far.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.92,1:04:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is she？- Come on，Kim，move！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.49,1:04:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't want to do this。- Keep going，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.02,1:04:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we going？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.78,1:04:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go straight。We have to go to the Embassy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.19,1:04:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.41,1:04:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do you know how to shoot？- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.51,1:04:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.00,1:04:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.79,1:04:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Officer down in Balat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.52,1:04:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.45,1:04:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit，cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.91,1:05:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，I have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.81,1:05:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I just shot one of them。Now，go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.29,1:05:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.33,1:05:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.63,1:05:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back，back，back！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.14,1:05:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，move！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.14,1:05:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.08,1:05:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.75,1:06:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.90,1:06:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.31,1:06:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Left！- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.54,1:06:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're in the taxi！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.22,1:06:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.09,1:06:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，no。- Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.16,1:06:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay low。Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.13,1:06:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，faster。- I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.81,1:06:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do it！- I can't！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.34,1:06:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，move！Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.16,1:06:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad！- Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.86,1:06:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.86,1:06:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.06,1:07:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.80,1:07:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Kim。Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.88,1:07:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go！Go！- Okay。I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.34,1:07:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.12,1:07:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn left.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.29,1:07:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.08,1:08:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.19,1:08:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep going。Stay low.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.54,1:08:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Faster，Kim。- I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.91,1:08:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，faster！- Dad！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.31,1:08:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.21,1:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.67,1:08:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.83,1:08:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here！Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.44,1:08:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.44,1:09:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll move.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.42,1:09:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down，Kim！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.84,1:09:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.43,1:09:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a suicide bomber.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.95,1:09:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.86,1:09:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.89,1:09:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep your head down，Kimmie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.66,1:09:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.55,1:09:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam，we're in a courtyard of the U.S。Embassy in Istanbul
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.91,1:09:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,in a smashed-up car.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.83,1:09:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.79,1:09:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you call someone to make sure we don't get shot？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.10,1:09:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.38,1:09:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.99,1:10:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Bry。He's in trouble in Istanbul.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.72,1:10:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom didn't get away，did she？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.43,1:10:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.47,1:10:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.36,1:10:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth。Is she…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.75,1:10:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，kim。No，she's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.43,1:10:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they have her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.91,1:10:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they will use her until they get what they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.28,1:10:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.62,1:10:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be safe here in the Embassy until I come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.48,1:10:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kimmie，it's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.05,1:10:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.77,1:10:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim，Kim，listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.83,1:10:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.44,1:10:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And bring your mom back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.27,1:10:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then I have to make sure these people
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.59,1:10:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,never bother us again in our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.19,1:10:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you going to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.01,1:10:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I do best.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.95,1:11:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Mills.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.08,1:11:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What should I do with you，Mrs。Mills？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.22,1:12:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have nothing against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't kill my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.71,1:12:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,But your husband did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.33,1:12:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，he betrayed you by choosing
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.07,1:12:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,to save your daughter instead of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.38,1:12:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,He left you here like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.84,1:13:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least my daughter is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.97,1:13:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Mills，you're a good mother，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.64,1:13:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a brave woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.05,1:13:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,For that，I'm going to send you back home
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.97,1:13:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.94,1:16:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.57,1:17:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ohri，shoot this dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.34,1:18:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go and see what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.69,1:18:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Move through here，to the hammam.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.12,1:18:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry！Hurry！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.14,1:19:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mirko！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.32,1:19:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mirko！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.32,1:19:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.68,1:19:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.82,1:20:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.43,1:21:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Bryan！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.48,1:21:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.49,1:21:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't come in！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.58,1:21:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.82,1:22:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.19,1:25:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.75,1:25:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here，baby。I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.90,1:25:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming back，Lennie。I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.20,1:25:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.92,1:26:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.21,1:26:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have other sons？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.25,1:26:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.26,1:26:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if I killed you，they will come and seek revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.84,1:26:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,They will，for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.13,1:26:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I will kill them，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.41,1:26:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can change that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.99,1:26:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can go home，live your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.20,1:26:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enjoy your sons，your grandsons.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.42,1:26:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,And my other son，
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.30,1:26:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marko.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.41,1:26:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The son you killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.63,1:26:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to just forget it？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.82,1:26:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.76,1:26:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will just have to live with it，
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.03,1:26:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like the parents of all those kidnapped girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.72,1:26:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or you can die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.66,1:26:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you telling me？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.87,1:27:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is，if you give me your word，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.83,1:27:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will throw down this gun and simply walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.71,1:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.45,1:27:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I am tired of it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.04,1:28:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lennie，I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.05,1:28:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here，baby。I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.86,1:28:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.97,1:28:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.13,1:28:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.40,1:28:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.09,1:28:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.75,1:28:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.32,1:28:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.28,1:28:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.71,1:28:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.21,1:29:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.08,1:29:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.90,1:29:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Line it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.97,1:29:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.71,1:29:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，begin to cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.25,1:29:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not too fast，not too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.19,1:29:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Straighten it out。Straighten，straighten.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.94,1:29:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.93,1:30:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop，stop，stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.51,1:30:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.51,1:30:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.01,1:30:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.91,1:30:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.95,1:30:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.38,1:30:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.21,1:30:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been saying that since the day you were born.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.16,1:30:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.20,1:30:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what would you like to do to celebrate？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.63,1:30:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.60,1:30:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.88,1:30:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I'll drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.27,1:30:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.68,1:31:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't knock it till you try it
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.99,1:31:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just come out to LA
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.80,1:31:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here you go。Three double-chocolate fudge.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.66,1:31:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.30,1:31:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's having the strawberry？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，but I just ordered three.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.75,1:31:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，the order said four.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.04,1:31:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ordered the fourth one.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.78,1:31:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,For who？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.53,1:31:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.96,1:31:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.55,1:31:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.49,1:31:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's cool if he joins us，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.11,1:31:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course it is，honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.65,1:31:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.68,1:31:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Of course it is，honey。- Behave.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.93,1:31:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you again，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.48,1:31:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice to see you，too。Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.59,1:31:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got you a strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.40,1:31:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.10,1:31:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.38,1:31:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't shoot this one。I really like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.86,Title,0,0,0,0,,《飓风营救2》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.49,0:02:15.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿尔巴尼亚）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:45.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（特罗波耶）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他屠杀我们的人民
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要为他们讨回公道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以亡灵的名义 向你们起誓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个夺去我们挚爱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个带给我们无尽痛苦和悲伤的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把他带回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.77,0:04:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将不眠不休
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他的鲜血洒满这片土地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.55,0:04:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要血债血偿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:24.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（洛杉矶）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:26.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（洗车场）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 打扰一下 - 什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗车的费用里包含了抛光
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 我喜欢自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点强迫症
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丽诺尔 - 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 今天周六 两点了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆不是要上驾驶课吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和音乐课调换了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,换的星期二的还是星期五的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子嘛 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是拼了命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想通过第三次驾校考试的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有那么渴望通过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她前两次都没通过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 她到底去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都不擅长说谎 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 说谎不是你的强项
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去她男朋友那了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她交男朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进来喝杯水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 她怎么都不告诉我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是不想你把她男友从幼儿园开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的情况都给调查一遍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 我知道这不关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.15,0:06:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,算不上好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分居了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 如果有什么我能帮上忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我还是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的红酒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道那孩子住哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经在72小时内
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一座1200万人口的城市里找到她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我刚刚已经说了 - 答应我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给她空间的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.89,0:07:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我告诉你我知晓的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我带你去我要去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想与你一起分享
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不让我说给你听呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金姆在吗 - 在 你是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯先生 见到你真荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰米
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝点什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道通过考试对你来说有多重要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 金姆 你没有驾照吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你试过平行停放凯迪拉克吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了你可以开我的车去考试
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:08:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很荣幸 米尔斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以稍微开慢点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信你会这么干
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周你就要放秋假了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我去伊斯坦布尔前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我唯一能腾出的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们计划好了 说到就要做到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 爸爸 是你自己计划的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么找到我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈谈过了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我你有男朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道你会反应过度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使只是假装的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想像个正常人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见停车标志记住要刹车 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈不知道杰米住哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球定位系统吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我装在你的手机里了 我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:09:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你听到那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生在你同龄人身上的恐怖事件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我都不知道怎么回到正常生活
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在这样绝对不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着后视镜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错 考试的时候你怎么做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我其实不是很想要驾照
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的出发点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得让我自己来解决
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么干了 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.27,0:11:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也别叫你朋友对他进行背景调查
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周三见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,两点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我人肉一个叫杰米·康拉德的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,和往常一样 不需要挖太多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮催尔先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你的挂号信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拿一下好吗 塞巴斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我玩花样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的花样也不少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏规则变了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人来到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用这张名片进到我们的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也杀了我兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用的就是你的名片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图 你去哪 回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 我去喊金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 跟我说说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们计划在金姆放春假的时候去中国旅游
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人一起 看能不能把问题给解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当斯图和我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得我和金姆一起出去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好一些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以释放点压力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他取消了所有安排
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有预定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信他居然这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得好累
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.13,0:16:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断地争执 还有离婚律师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成了一个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 这不是你的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该由我来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会解决这些问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你和金姆跟我一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不能打扰你 你要工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会打扰到我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只工作三天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们就可以过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我现在心里很乱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我明白 不要有压力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明早出发 工作三天 给我打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们来 我就多待几天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不来 我就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去叫金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 别说了 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该坚持让她来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别纠结了 伙计们 放过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最近过的很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再给她添乱了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你们还这么亲密啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的婚姻问题都跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 你们过去很亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在你们又和好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌她还对他有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说到哪儿去了 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是他对她有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能聊聊篮球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天 别说这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:37.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿尔巴尼亚 地拉那）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊斯坦布尔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 米尔斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我在这里很有安全感
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.69,0:18:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是丽诺尔 听到哔声后请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听到你的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你可能有别的地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你没那么难受了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你需要聊聊 有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会陪着你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概明天乘船离开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有金姆的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计和她男友在一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 金姆 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉妮 - 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正给你留言 没听到消息 我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想给你个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真让我惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能离开这里回家去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈给萨姆打过电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在追踪你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可不是只有你一个会随机应变
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到伊斯坦布尔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算差吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.64,0:19:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 快来看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.81,0:19:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是太感谢你了 - 我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们先收拾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我半小时之后来接你们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪儿也不去 我累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好泡个澡再上床休息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.87,0:21:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.55,0:21:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就只剩我和你了 姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有特别想去的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,算有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也打算走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.15,0:22:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不呢 我打算在逗留几个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.53,0:22:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爽啊 - 假的 我说笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧 - 好吧 这儿可真疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边是欧洲 那边是亚洲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.85,0:22:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的2500年间 所有的战争
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是西方侵略东方还是东方攻击西方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.89,0:22:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要经过这条水路
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想喝茶吗 宝贝 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯就好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些事情的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.02,0:22:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐飞机过来时 在书上看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想看的话可以借你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对那个杰米
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.33,0:22:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,话题转换得还真是自然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,才几个月而已
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.09,0:23:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你原来爱过谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是妈妈说的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.02,0:23:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你们相遇的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.78,0:23:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常特别
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常特别 她这么说的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的原话是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,神奇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.88,0:24:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次见到你很高兴 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.07,0:24:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都按你要求准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.11,0:24:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.86,0:25:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 他在大厅
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.58,0:25:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他出来再动手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 抓活的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.51,0:25:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他注意到我了 我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.48,0:25:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们是要去集市上吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.94,0:25:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我时差还没倒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以想到泳池边放松一下 你们去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点见
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.78,0:26:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 你一个人可以吗 - 当然 可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.41,0:26:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 拜拜 - 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.86,0:26:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说的那本书 在我的梳妆台上
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.43,0:26:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.17,0:26:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别到处跑 我去叫车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.13,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.33,0:26:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的小把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.66,0:26:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.15,0:26:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他女儿待在旅店 要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.84,0:26:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个都不放过
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.72,0:26:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.43,0:26:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我们想得太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.54,0:26:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.43,0:26:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想当个丘比特
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.57,0:26:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.23,0:26:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次回来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说想弥补
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.37,0:26:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,亏欠金姆的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.96,0:26:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 好吧 他最多能待三个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.05,0:26:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常你也只能待那么长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,相差也不过一周左右
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.53,0:27:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟太紧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.95,0:27:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实证明我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.58,0:27:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你永远不会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不会
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.16,0:27:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,本性难移吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.68,0:27:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每做一件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.16,0:27:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.24,0:27:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像狗啃骨头一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比喻很形象
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.03,0:27:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.81,0:27:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做事时都是百分百的投入
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去我做一件事 就只会想那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我告诫自己要有所改变
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.47,0:27:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是无法放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.98,0:27:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放弃了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 永远不会
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里绝不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.08,0:27:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机 麻烦左转
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.97,0:28:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 别回头
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.17,0:28:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.83,0:28:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到中间那家画廊了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.22,0:28:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能不能告诉我怎么了 - 看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.90,0:28:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,车一停
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.76,0:28:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就下车假装要去购物
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.34,0:28:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后进去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.77,0:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.74,0:28:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快告诉我 - 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.39,0:28:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后从针织店后门出来 再右转
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.34,0:28:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一路口再右转
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.02,0:28:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着下一个路口左转
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.83,0:28:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走一直到一段台阶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.82,0:28:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有个红色走廊 是条小巷
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.97,0:28:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了小巷 有个出租车站
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到酒店
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.27,0:29:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到金姆 然后去找酒店的保安主管
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.69,0:29:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求他在你们房间周围布好警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人敲门都不要开
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.18,0:29:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,客户服务 警察 谁都别开门
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.38,0:29:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在房间里等我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.60,0:29:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.70,0:29:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得集中精力
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.38,0:29:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.14,0:29:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.83,0:29:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你做好准备 你必须做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.38,0:29:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 集中精神
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机 停车
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.00,0:29:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.16,0:29:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该当心的是跟踪我们的那帮小子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.27,0:29:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗叼着骨头的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.55,0:29:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别跟它抢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.56,0:29:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.67,0:29:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.36,0:29:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 起来 起来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.27,0:29:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.73,0:30:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.32,0:30:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 金姆 快接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.51,0:31:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.57,0:32:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙 拜托 帮我开下门
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.73,0:32:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.60,0:34:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过来我就打爆他的头
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.77,0:34:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.28,0:34:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.03,0:34:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望你也在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.67,0:34:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 你不知道我有多想
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.44,0:34:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.66,0:34:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爸的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.83,0:34:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正和我妈约会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.23,0:34:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会再聊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.47,0:34:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,想你 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.25,0:35:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真听我说 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.56,0:35:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.37,0:35:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人挟持了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.77,0:35:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.79,0:35:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.99,0:35:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那帮人也会去找你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.50,0:35:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,悄悄地离开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.07,0:35:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去我跟你说放那本书的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.18,0:35:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有扇门 开门进去 藏到衣橱里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.03,0:35:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听明白了吗 - 明白
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.92,0:35:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我会打电话给你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.89,0:35:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.72,0:35:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.67,0:35:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.01,0:36:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在422房间
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.08,0:36:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.08,0:36:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,四
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,五
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.08,0:36:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,六
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.64,0:36:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.99,0:36:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人的歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.21,0:36:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:36:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,四
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有船
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.71,0:37:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,游泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.64,0:37:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安 这是四楼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.06,0:37:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.53,0:37:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上派人过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.61,0:37:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十五
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.85,0:37:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十六
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.67,0:37:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十七
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.60,0:37:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十八
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.70,0:37:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十九
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.13,0:37:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.81,0:37:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.83,0:37:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.79,0:37:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去她爸房间看看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.80,0:38:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,敲击金属的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.06,0:38:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转 换到二档
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.52,0:38:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.20,0:38:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟叫声
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.28,0:38:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到他们了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.32,0:38:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 阿凡提 两个都带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.44,0:39:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们直接带到店里去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.52,0:39:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.91,0:39:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一双人字拖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.97,0:39:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走左边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.27,0:39:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.64,0:39:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十七
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.89,0:39:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.16,0:39:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.06,0:40:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开的枪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.05,0:42:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 萨姆 接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.18,0:42:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是萨姆 请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.61,0:42:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.01,0:42:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.26,0:42:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.86,0:42:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.32,0:42:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.50,0:42:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 仔细听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.87,0:42:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要冷静 集中精神
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.86,0:42:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.76,0:42:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓你的人走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.04,0:42:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了 他们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.61,0:42:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会查清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.50,0:42:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.10,0:43:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.81,0:43:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈没事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.12,0:43:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.99,0:43:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去美国大使馆 那里很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.51,0:43:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.79,0:43:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想到办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.06,0:43:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.51,0:43:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不确定 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.64,0:43:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 那我让他们去哪儿找你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.89,0:43:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要 你快走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.09,0:43:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.21,0:43:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.17,0:43:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 告诉我该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.27,0:43:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 金姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.29,0:43:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你跟我说该做什么 我能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.42,0:43:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 这不是一场游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.66,0:43:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 事关我父母的生死
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.33,0:43:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.01,0:43:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.58,0:43:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.84,0:43:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.96,0:43:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能安全离开衣橱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.89,0:43:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.55,0:44:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 带上箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.86,0:44:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.89,0:44:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.82,0:44:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码是232884
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.08,0:44:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开了吗 - 打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.51,0:44:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 看到地图了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.34,0:44:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.97,0:44:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开地图
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图上方有比例尺
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.40,0:44:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.07,0:44:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.78,0:44:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,从衣橱里的鞋上扯根鞋带
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.48,0:44:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它做标尺
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.54,0:44:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,箱子里有支钢笔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.70,0:44:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.23,0:44:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以酒店为中心画个圆
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.32,0:45:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 以三千米为直径
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.95,0:45:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.83,0:45:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 画好了 - 以超市为中心再画一个圆
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.66,0:45:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 两个圆有交点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.33,0:45:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.41,0:45:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出一个小罐子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.22,0:45:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有插销的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.10,0:45:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.02,0:45:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着手榴弹去阳台
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.57,0:45:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有安全的地方可以扔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.52,0:45:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.62,0:45:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.74,0:45:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.46,0:45:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手榴弹的插销拔掉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.44,0:45:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三 要让我听见
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.90,0:45:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量扔远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.90,0:45:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后立即跑回房间
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.57,0:45:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挂电话 我要听见爆炸声
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.27,0:45:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.53,0:45:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.78,0:45:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.86,0:46:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.83,0:46:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.82,0:46:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.94,0:46:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,四
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.02,0:46:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在在地图上以酒店为中心画个圆
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.26,0:46:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,周长四千五百米
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.59,0:46:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 有交点了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.14,0:46:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个交点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.74,0:46:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在其中一个交点附近
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.96,0:46:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去外面看看房顶上的旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.62,0:46:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到旗帜了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.08,0:46:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到了 - 有风吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.84,0:46:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有 - 向东飘 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.12,0:46:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的 你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.56,0:46:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看地图
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到东边那个交点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.37,0:46:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所在的位置去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.92,0:47:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上一支手枪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.60,0:47:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到屋顶 等我电话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.33,0:47:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,再带上两个手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.97,0:47:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最东侧的屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.86,0:47:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,到屋顶后等我电话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.29,0:47:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 金姆 不要被发现
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.08,0:47:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.07,0:47:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.44,0:47:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.71,0:48:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.46,0:48:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那衣服不是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.91,0:48:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.36,0:48:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓小偷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.64,0:49:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.37,0:49:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.30,0:49:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.59,0:49:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.24,0:49:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.25,0:49:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人你都不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.96,0:50:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说 他们没有任何意义
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.64,0:50:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对有些人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.62,0:50:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是儿子和孙子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.96,0:50:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲还有丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.32,0:50:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你把他们全杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.97,0:50:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你眼里他们一文不值
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.06,0:50:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.48,0:50:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.49,0:50:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.09,0:50:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有直接杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.68,0:50:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是把他绑在椅子上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.41,0:50:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给椅子接上电缆
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.48,0:50:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,接通电源
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.46,0:50:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,活活把他电死
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.26,0:50:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拐骗了几十个女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.11,0:50:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了她们的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.93,0:50:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.61,0:50:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,马可 来自特罗波耶
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.89,0:50:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来是想把你带到特罗波耶
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.12,0:51:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你看看你是如何毁了别人的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.93,0:51:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还他们一个公道
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.13,0:51:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想为他们报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.00,0:51:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能给我们带来安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.92,0:51:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱怎么说随便
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.84,0:51:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀你儿子是因为他绑架了我女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.53,0:51:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管他做过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.30,0:51:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道我再也看不到他的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.45,0:51:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也听不到他的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.51,0:51:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你为你女儿杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.36,0:51:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要让你为他的死负责
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.99,0:51:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你痛痛快快地死
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.40,0:51:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你求生不得 求死不能
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.29,0:51:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在你死之前
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.81,0:51:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.41,0:51:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.28,0:51:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.19,0:52:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液全部冲满脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.53,0:52:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再从伤口流出来需要多长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.60,0:52:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概三十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.35,0:52:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你真是行家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.23,0:52:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说这三十分钟你只能眼睁睁看着她死
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.69,0:52:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关她的事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.61,0:52:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么冲我来 让她走
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.36,0:52:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我逞英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.40,0:52:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就会抓到你女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.74,0:52:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会被卖到最低级的妓院
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.53,0:52:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.62,0:53:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,被无数男人凌辱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.29,0:53:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成一坨烂肉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.82,0:53:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,连狗都不理
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.56,0:53:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他们胡说 莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.52,0:53:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.69,0:53:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟她通了话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.27,0:53:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.15,0:53:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得保持冷静 慢慢呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.57,0:53:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.53,0:53:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会让你们两个出事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.16,0:53:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.33,0:53:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.79,0:53:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.25,0:53:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没抓到那女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.58,0:53:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.21,0:53:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到她就回来 然后我们再走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.25,0:53:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.17,0:53:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.57,0:54:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 莉妮 撑住
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.60,0:54:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.03,0:54:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.73,0:54:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 抱歉 - 回来 你还没付钱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.97,0:54:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.79,0:54:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.05,0:54:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 亲爱的 我在这 我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.12,0:55:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快打电话来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.92,0:55:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.07,0:55:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.70,0:55:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 莉妮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.03,0:55:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.11,0:55:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.86,0:55:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再扔个手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.44,0:56:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 已经很近了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.51,0:56:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直往东走
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.64,0:56:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,数三十下 然后再扔一个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.02,0:56:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.98,0:56:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,十八 十九
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.74,0:56:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十六 二十七
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.41,0:56:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十八 二十九
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.06,0:56:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.22,0:56:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去看看什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.25,0:56:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金姆 - 我在
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.21,0:56:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,向东看 有没有一团白蒸汽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.74,0:56:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.54,0:56:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑过去 到了告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.16,0:57:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.02,0:57:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.72,0:57:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在蒸汽这里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.00,0:57:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪从排气口扔下来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.03,0:57:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他们来了 他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.91,0:57:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪扔下来 金姆 然后快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.39,0:57:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.69,0:57:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.75,0:58:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.84,1:00:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.29,1:00:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.06,1:00:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.91,1:00:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.12,1:00:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.09,1:00:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.70,1:00:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.59,1:00:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈在哪里 她还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.83,1:00:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很安全 很安全
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.54,1:00:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点 慢点 慢点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.46,1:00:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有生意了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.96,1:01:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人身上的刺青跟巴黎那些人一样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.47,1:01:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要的不是你 金姆 是我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.58,1:01:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里等着 我去救妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.16,1:01:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果五分钟之后我还没出来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.48,1:01:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就直接去美国大使馆
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.68,1:01:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉他们发生了什么 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.53,1:01:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 金姆 手机拿过来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.57,1:01:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只等五分钟 一秒也不要多等
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.19,1:01:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论发生什么 时间一到你就走
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.05,1:01:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.47,1:01:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.81,1:03:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.26,1:03:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.27,1:03:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.66,1:03:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.09,1:04:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 你杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.97,1:04:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.95,1:04:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈在哪 - 她没事 就在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.92,1:04:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里 - 快点 金姆 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.49,1:04:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想这么做 - 继续走 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.02,1:04:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.78,1:04:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走 我们得去大使馆
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.19,1:04:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.41,1:04:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会开枪吗 - 不会
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.51,1:04:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就老实开车
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.00,1:04:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.79,1:04:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉特区有警官遇害
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.52,1:04:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.45,1:04:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 有警察
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.91,1:05:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我得停车
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.81,1:05:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我刚打死了一个 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.29,1:05:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.33,1:05:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.63,1:05:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快倒 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.14,1:05:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.14,1:05:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.08,1:05:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.75,1:06:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.90,1:06:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.31,1:06:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左转 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.54,1:06:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那辆出租车上
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.22,1:06:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.09,1:06:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.16,1:06:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴低点 继续走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.13,1:06:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 加速 - 不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.81,1:06:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你行的 - 我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.34,1:06:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 闪开 闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.16,1:06:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 继续走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.86,1:06:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.86,1:06:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.06,1:07:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.80,1:07:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 金姆 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.88,1:07:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 走 - 好 我在走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.34,1:07:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 继续走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.12,1:07:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.29,1:07:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.08,1:08:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.19,1:08:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 趴低点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.54,1:08:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再快点 金姆 - 我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.91,1:08:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油 再快点 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.31,1:08:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.21,1:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.67,1:08:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲过去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.76,1:08:50.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国大使馆）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.83,1:08:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这 别停下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.44,1:08:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那些士兵
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.44,1:09:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会闪开的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.42,1:09:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.84,1:09:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.43,1:09:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个汽车炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.95,1:09:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.86,1:09:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.89,1:09:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头低下 金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.66,1:09:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.55,1:09:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我们在伊斯坦布尔的美国大使馆
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.91,1:09:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,院子里的一辆破车里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.83,1:09:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.79,1:09:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让他们别向我们开枪吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.10,1:09:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.38,1:09:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.99,1:10:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是布莱恩 他在伊斯坦布尔有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.72,1:10:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈没逃出来 是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.43,1:10:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.47,1:10:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.36,1:10:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说实话 她是不是…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.75,1:10:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 金姆 她没死
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.43,1:10:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她在他们手上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.91,1:10:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会利用她得到他们想要的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.28,1:10:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.62,1:10:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来之前 你待在大使馆会很安全
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.48,1:10:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 会没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.05,1:10:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都糟透了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.77,1:10:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆 金姆 听着
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.83,1:10:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须找到他们
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.44,1:10:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你妈妈带回来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.27,1:10:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我要确保这些人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.59,1:10:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后再也不会找我们的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.19,1:10:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.01,1:10:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我最拿手的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.95,1:11:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯夫人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.08,1:11:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该拿你怎么办呢 米尔斯夫人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.22,1:12:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是针对你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子不是你杀的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.71,1:12:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你丈夫杀的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.33,1:12:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 他背叛了你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.07,1:12:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他选择去救你们的女儿 而不是你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.38,1:12:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你像狗一样丢在这
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.84,1:13:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我女儿还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.97,1:13:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯夫人 你是个好母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.64,1:13:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是个勇敢的女人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.05,1:13:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我会把你送回家
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.97,1:13:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块一块地送回去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.94,1:16:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.57,1:17:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧利 快毙了那条狗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.34,1:18:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.69,1:18:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 这边 去浴场
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.12,1:18:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.14,1:19:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔科
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.32,1:19:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔科
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.32,1:19:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在这
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.68,1:19:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.82,1:20:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.43,1:21:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.48,1:21:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.49,1:21:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能进来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.58,1:21:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.82,1:22:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.19,1:25:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.75,1:25:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这 亲爱的 我在这
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.90,1:25:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.20,1:25:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.92,1:26:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还等什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.21,1:26:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有其他儿子吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.25,1:26:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.26,1:26:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我杀了你 他们会来找我报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.84,1:26:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.13,1:26:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也会把他们杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.41,1:26:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能改变这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.99,1:26:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以回家 好好生活
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.20,1:26:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟儿孙共聚天伦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.42,1:26:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我另一个儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.30,1:26:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,马可
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.41,1:26:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死的那个
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.63,1:26:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该就这么忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.82,1:26:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.76,1:26:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该接受这个现实
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.03,1:26:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那些被绑架的女孩的父母一样
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.72,1:26:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你就会死在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.66,1:26:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.87,1:27:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 如果你向我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.83,1:27:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把枪扔掉 离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.71,1:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.45,1:27:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我厌倦了这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.04,1:28:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉妮 我在这
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.05,1:28:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这 亲爱的 我在这
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.86,1:28:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.97,1:28:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.13,1:28:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.40,1:28:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.09,1:28:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.75,1:28:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.32,1:28:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,金姆
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.28,1:28:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.71,1:28:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很安全
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.21,1:29:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.19,1:29:21.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（三周后）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.36,1:29:35.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（车管所 此处仅限报考者）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.08,1:29:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.90,1:29:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,车身摆正
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.97,1:29:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.71,1:29:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 开始倒车
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.25,1:29:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太快 别太快
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.19,1:29:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,方向盘回正 回正 回正
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.94,1:29:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.93,1:30:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停 停
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.51,1:30:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.51,1:30:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,满分
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.01,1:30:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.91,1:30:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.95,1:30:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.38,1:30:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做得很完美
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.21,1:30:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你出生那天起我就这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.16,1:30:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.20,1:30:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么庆祝
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.63,1:30:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.60,1:30:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.88,1:30:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我来开车
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.27,1:30:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.68,1:31:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力之前 不言放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.99,1:31:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出家门 奔向洛城
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.80,1:31:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 三份双层巧克力乳脂软糖冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.66,1:31:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.30,1:31:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份草莓的给谁
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我只点了三份
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.75,1:31:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但单子上写了四份
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.04,1:31:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我点的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.78,1:31:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给谁的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.53,1:31:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.96,1:31:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来的正好
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.55,1:31:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰米
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.49,1:31:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以跟我们一起 对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.11,1:31:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.65,1:31:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.68,1:31:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然可以 亲爱的 - 礼貌点
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.93,1:31:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次见到你很高兴 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.48,1:31:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很高兴见到你 坐下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.59,1:31:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你点了份草莓的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.40,1:31:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,少说两句吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.10,1:31:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.38,1:31:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人你可不能打 我真的很喜欢他
